This dataset is derived from the MassBank record archive maintained by the
MassBank consortium (https://github.com/MassBank/MassBank-data,
https://doi.org/10.5281/zenodo.3378723).

Every record included here carries either "CC BY" or "CC0" in its own MassBank
LICENSE field. Records under non-commercial (CC BY-NC, CC BY-NC-SA) or
share-alike (CC BY-SA) terms were excluded during assembly.

You are free to share and adapt this material for any purpose, including
commercially, provided you give appropriate credit to the MassBank consortium
and indicate if changes were made.

